It would, however as everyone has pointed out it wastes a lot of
"net bandwidth".

I used to get the odd request for nethack and elm, so what I started
doing was maintaining a fully patched version that anyone could
pick up.  Then whenever anyone posts a request for the patched version
I can point them to the one I've already got ready.

I assume that other people have done something similar, perhaps when
they see postings like this they can announce where they've got it.

